ES:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Tengo las paredes muy vacías.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Está todo como desangelado.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}Si tienes alguna idea de cómo
podría decorar las paredes,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
tú avísame, ¿vale?

TRANSLATION:
Duvarları süsleyecek bir şey arıyorum.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}
Elinden çıkarmaya kıyacağın bir şey
varsa bana versene,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

EN:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}I wonder{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} if there's a way to make
my room look cooler.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0016:}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}}I know!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Do you have any furniture you 
could recommend to me?
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Anything will do. I trust your taste,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Acaba{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} odamı daha havalı göstermenin
bir yolu var mı?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0016:}}{{TAG:0007:000B:}}Buldum!{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} {{TAG:000E:0003:}}{{TAG:0005:0008:}}!{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Bana önerebileceğin bir mobilya var mı?
{{TAG:0003:0005:}}Ne olursa olur. Zevkine güveniyorum,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Meine Wohnung ist so leer.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Das ist irgendwie deprimierend.{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
Außerdem hallt es so.
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Vielleicht könnte ich die Leere mit
riesigen Möbeln füllen?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}} Kannst du
mir vielleicht welche empfehlen?

{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Irgendwas fehlt in meinem Haus,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}Vielleicht ein schönes Möbelstück?{{TAG:0007:0000:28000000}}
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Sag mir doch Bescheid, wenn dir
was einfällt, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Evimde bir şey eksik gibi, {{TAG:0005:0008:}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}
Boşluğu dolduracak bir mobilya vardır belki.
{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Parlak bir fikrin varsa{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} söyle, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

DE:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Irgendwas fehlt in meiner Wohnung.{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}}
Aber was,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} {{TAG:0005:0007:}}?{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Etwas Dekoration könnte vielleicht
nicht schaden!{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}Fällt dir was ein, das man auf {{TAG:000E:0008:00CD0A00650069006E0065006E000800650069006E0065000600650069006E00}}
{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}} stellen
könnte?

TRANSLATION:
{{TAG:0003:000B:}}Biliyor musun,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} evimde bir şey eksik{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
Havalılık seviyesini yükseltecek
bir mobilya lazım.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}} üstüne koyabileceğim
bir şey için fikrin varsa söyle.

{{TAG:0003:000B:}}{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}} parçasını
başka bir şeyle değiştirmeyi düşünüyorum.{{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0001:}}
Aklına bir şey gelirse{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}} söyle, {{TAG:0005:0007:}}.

{{TAG:0003:0009:}}Duvarlarım fazla boş,{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} bu da evi
biraz yalnız gösteriyor. {{TAG:0000:0004:}}{{TAG:0003:0000:}}
Duvar süsü önerin varsa{{TAG:0007:0000:14000000}} bana da söyle!

FR:
{{TAG:0003:0017:}}Comment tu trouves ça,
{{TAG:000E:0001:}}{{TAG:0011:0003:0000}}
de mon mur, {{TAG:0005:0008:}} ?
{{TAG:0003:000D:}}Si tu sais ce que je pourrais mettre
à la place, montre-le-moi,{{TAG:0007:0000:08000000}}
{{TAG:0005:0007:}}.
